"""
Tyrant Unleashed API Commander - Standalone Version
Works without the tyrant module; resolves card names from XML files

Main Features:
  • Dominion Auto-Build - Automatic fusion path with reset support
  • Shop Functions - 2000-Gold packages
  • Salvage Functions - L1 Commons/Rares bulk salvage
  • Buyback Functions - Cards from Buyback store
  • Card-Building - Fusion recipes with SP costs
  • Quests & Achievements - Progress overview with rewards
  • Shards - Use Epic/Legendary/Vindicator shard stacks
  • Arena Auto-Attack - Loop until stamina empty
  • Quest Missions - Play missions linked to quests
  
Usage:
  python TyrantAPICommander.py          # Normal mode
  python TyrantAPICommander.py --debug  # Debug mode
"""

